#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/02-observability.md:5
#: 78f5cdd52564490ca6fb4ecb74147d38
msgid ""
"What operators look at first: `fs_cli -x status`, "
"`$log_dir/freeswitch.log`, then Sofia/channel listings. This tree has "
"**no** `mod_prometheus` and no in-repo Grafana/Prometheus dashboards. "
"Counters live in `fs_cli` / ESL events; optional SNMP is compiled off by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"运维人员首先看：`fs_cli -x status`、`$log_dir/freeswitch.log`，然后是 Sofia/channel "
"列表。本代码树 **没有** `mod_prometheus`，仓库内也没有 Grafana/Prometheus 仪表盘。计数器在 "
"`fs_cli` / ESL 事件里；可选 SNMP 默认未编译进去。"

