#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/02-observability.md:65
#: 3ee228b47ffe457ca7850aa91d350763
msgid ""
"Vanilla `logfile.conf.xml` leaves `<param name=\"logfile\" "
"value=\"/var/log/freeswitch.log\"/>` **commented**; the computed "
"`log_dir` path is what actually opens."
msgstr ""
"Vanilla `logfile.conf.xml` 把 `<param name=\"logfile\" "
"value=\"/var/log/freeswitch.log\"/>` **注释掉了**；真正打开的是计算得到的 `log_dir` 路径。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/02-observability.md:67
#: 557901f94336406fb248f65ced63b420
msgid ""
"Rotation: `rollover` 1048576000 bytes, `maximum-rotate` 32, `rotate-on-"
"hup` true. The Debian unit (`debian/freeswitch-"
"systemd.freeswitch.service`) does not define `ExecReload`; use `fs_cli -x"
" \"fsctl send_sighup\"` or an explicit `kill -HUP`. The separate template"
" `build/freeswitch.service` does define `ExecReload=/usr/bin/kill -HUP "
"$MAINPID`. Either HUP path fires `SWITCH_EVENT_TRAP` with `Trapped-"
"Signal=HUP`, allowing `mod_logfile` to rotate."
msgstr ""
"轮转：`rollover` 为 1048576000 字节，`maximum-rotate` 为 32，`rotate-on-hup` 为 "
"true。Debian unit（`debian/freeswitch-systemd.freeswitch.service`）没有定义 "
"`ExecReload`；请使用 `fs_cli -x \"fsctl send_sighup\"` 或显式执行 `kill "
"-HUP`。单独的模板 `build/freeswitch.service` 定义了 `ExecReload=/usr/bin/kill -HUP"
" $MAINPID`。任一 HUP 路径都会触发带有 `Trapped-Signal=HUP` 的 `SWITCH_EVENT_TRAP`，使 "
"`mod_logfile` 能够轮转。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/02-observability.md:76
#: 2331485801b14704adb330acf228484f
msgid "systemd journal vs the log file"
msgstr "systemd journal 与日志文件"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/02-observability.md:78
#: 452d543272384c17b8a7aa6ab5910253
msgid ""
"Debian `debian/freeswitch-systemd.freeswitch.service` is `Type=forking` "
"with `-ncwait`. It does **not** set `StandardOutput=journal`. `journalctl"
" -u freeswitch` shows unit start/stop (and any leftover stdout of the "
"forking parent), **not** the full switch log."
msgstr ""
"Debian `debian/freeswitch-systemd.freeswitch.service` 是带 `-ncwait` 的 "
"`Type=forking`。它 **没有** 设置 `StandardOutput=journal`。`journalctl -u "
"freeswitch` 显示 unit 启停（以及 fork 父进程残留的 stdout），**不是** 完整的交换机日志。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/02-observability.md:80
#: 61fd6b7d489c43e18e92f99d09f399ad
msgid ""
"`mod_syslog` is **compiled** (`build/modules.conf.in`: "
"`loggers/mod_syslog`) but **not loaded** in vanilla (`modules.conf.xml` "
"comments it out). If you load it, "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/syslog.conf.xml` sends facility `user`, "
"ident `freeswitch`, default level `warning`, with UUIDs. On systemd hosts"
" that often appears in the journal via the syslog socket."
msgstr ""
"`mod_syslog` **已编译**（`build/modules.conf.in`：`loggers/mod_syslog`），但 "
"vanilla **未加载**（`modules.conf.xml` "
"把它注释掉了）。若加载它，`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/syslog.conf.xml` 会以 facility "
"`user`、ident `freeswitch`、默认级别 `warning` 发送，并带 UUID。在 systemd 主机上，这通常经 "
"syslog 套接字出现在 journal 里。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/02-observability.md:82
#: deaf8d37027e4c06b49e0297b4fdd5df
